# The game board embedded beside a side panel (Guide, Puzzle): the status pill, the action row and the controls bar centre on the
# board view (the window minus the 424 px panel), the bar does not run under the panel, and the Submit tooltip waits for its dwell.
# Layout (1400x800): main menu Guide (150,430), Puzzles (150,370); Guide Back (125,25); first puzzle "Back rank" (276,222).
# In the 976 px board view the action row is centred on 488 (Submit is the third button, at (632,90)).
wait 20
click 150 430        # Guide
wait 40
capture layout-guide-hud
clicksq 0 2 d2       # a pawn: Submit stays disabled, but hovering it explains why
wait 20
clicksq 0 2 d4       # a move is pending: Submit now lists it
wait 40
move 632 90          # rest the pointer on Submit
wait 40              # past the 400 ms dwell
capture layout-guide-submit-tooltip
click 125 25         # Back to the main menu
wait 40
click 150 370        # Puzzles
wait 40
click 276 222        # Back rank
move 880 740
wait 60
capture layout-puzzle-hud
